model {
  extend basalt.modelGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Each retained and duplex WebSocket turn validates the bound credential against current Home funding policy before forwarding bytes. An explicit provider pre-content refusal may retry on the same downstream socket; the new attempt binds funding checks to its selected account. A funding refusal asks the client to reconnect with full context and never transfers an account-owned response ID, forwards the denied successor or interrupts an in-flight turn. Old Home cannot silently treat validation as another dispatch. Wire proofs accept Redis command casing while requiring the validation request type and pinned account identity."
    }
  }
}
